d its carrier, the attack edge does not propagate. Consequently, the grounded extension computes a large 'standing residue' (0909868ae3d22218) of unretired rivals. To fix this, a strict 'downgrade, then audit' policy (0c74fc8b6042157a) must be applied to criticism-weighted attention, ensuring that coverage debt triggers forced retirement of the weakest rivals when the standing residue exceeds a bounded threshold, preventing unbounded growth.","optional_refs":[],"sidecar":{"requested_context_aliases":["src-74ded11eccee525366948958d3b4fb57bccbdeb2"],"search_signal":"productive"},"typicality":0.72}],"simulation_proposals":[]}